# ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}

Typed bindings for {{.ProviderDisplay}} (`[dynamic_providers.{{.ShortName}}]`,
{{.SourceNote}}), generated by
[ubx](https://github.com/ubiquex/ubiquex) (`ubx sdk gen`), for all three
SDK languages in one combined repo:

- [`sdk/go/`](sdk/go/) -- Go bindings, module `github.com/ubiquex/ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}/sdk/go`
  (a subdirectory Go module, tagged `sdk/go/vX.Y.Z`)
- [`sdk/typescript/`](sdk/typescript/) -- TypeScript bindings, published to npm as
  [`@ubx/sdk-{{.ShortName}}`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ubx/sdk-{{.ShortName}})
- [`sdk/python/`](sdk/python/) -- Python bindings, published to PyPI as
  [`ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}`](https://pypi.org/project/ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}/)
  (imported as `ubx.{{.ShortName}}.*`, a real PEP 420 namespace package)

## Install

```
go get github.com/ubiquex/ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}/sdk/go
npm install @ubx/sdk-{{.ShortName}}
pip install ubx-sdk-{{.ShortName}}
```

Every file except each language's own `doc.{go,ts}` / `__init__.py` is
generated -- do not hand-edit; re-run `ubx sdk gen` after the source
schema changes.

Depends on the shared runtime: [ubx-sdk-go](https://github.com/ubiquex/ubx-sdk-go) (Go),
[`@ubx/sdk`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@ubx/sdk) (TypeScript),
[`ubx-sdk`](https://pypi.org/project/ubx-sdk/) (Python, imported as `ubx_sdk`).

